      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "现在回想起来，从那场比赛起，\n就能开始窥见她异于常人的强悍才能。",
      "source_fingerprint": "481f5fe01a31112aa2c5fcd6015af62352e48213d635186c324c0fa024e0d477",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
