      "uid": "zhcn:5d7c23d364ef10a3ee1126cc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……跟我来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd5fe8da3c6583f3faccb8fff71880bf02d00badc092c9eaa7d1ca90484cae2c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3ce73cb1789f4f024dfacc8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后我被她带到了一个地方……\n那里装饰着印着鲁道夫象征照片的\n“菊花赏”大海报。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b23275c82a9d2c349a04b13cdffc658d55cfd3a2837d46e76ab3a957d0d43d2b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
