    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a999ddf1371781fe086173b9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我要在经典级的三冠路线──\n不对，我要在闪耀系列赛的每场比赛中，\n涂改掉“那家伙”的一切。",
      "source_fingerprint": "667e19626df4243c60d17731b55a32ef778fc9b5c834b9dac41f20e0a6404577",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00aa482e74a2a7fdd109359c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天狼星象征",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ec317440b52f89fbdfad76110a7afc3ac55b01c91d67997968e5ba969bc9ea2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8b42f4273ead50f00622eab",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我会跨越那个假圣人留下的战绩，\n然后在隆尚的天空下大放光彩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "67b94d3875c9f74c84e740f2575b71468ab11a474b269ca1464b27f8589938f8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47d8978edf458ec0df643d57",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天狼星象征用锐利的目光，\n抬头仰望着“她”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e7a38397930061197c68e55e92d1e69b1db103b486ef8535bf6bfbabce03d1c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7385522f9e0bf1a8084b0309",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "回到自己房间后，我回想起她的样子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "867f5477a9ca3d0386a2dba3639295a1b690d499054ee50ccb5b3a32afbaf6d1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7517eb34f9ec681830e3a9f7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从那眼神看来，\n她之所以选择走上经典三冠路线，\n似乎源自对鲁道夫象征的竞争心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "baf961d63cc6b572964728d94fe9110ee78e18b6649f5802a967fa50a40432d2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
