    {
      "uid": "zhcn:806120464606a4a53b764ab1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然会是经典级后半以后的事了，\n不过把这当成在国内时的目标，\n以此为基准安排参赛计划似乎是个好主意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cafb6fbc560de3b4921bfca7a18b7e03787263d1b3032905c275200c9963861",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
