    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19f771f858e5bd50308837fe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鲁道夫象征被称为前所未闻的存在，\n不可能没有跟她一战的价值，\n这种事情她应该也知道才对。更重要的是──",
      "source_fingerprint": "488d526bca5ad1133221c65c6e3c61ef75f05eb3c3940702dde354d4de2080bf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1070/storytimeline_501070304.json",
