    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4c6b287205a1c7be3347a60",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要说能够接受的话是骗人的。\n──不过我也尚未把握住事情全貌，尚不知\n过去她和鲁道夫象征之间究竟发生过什么事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8179b4c7b7937a2d2dc14609329fecf21938cec1706fb4a5d8dfb7855161ce48",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
