      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我将这小小的烦恼藏在心底，\n以“皋月赏”为目标的日子就此展开。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ef5864a49cabe6f0ad6e00811a29e22f085c314d5e38cd2e5f87d9ca92e33ce",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
